#: ../../source/reference/cli/freeports-dev.md
msgid "`Makefile`, `make.bat`"
msgstr "`Makefile`, `make.bat`"

#: ../../source/reference/cli/freeports-dev.md
msgid "the single entry point — every target, and the Windows shim that calls it"
msgstr "o único ponto de entrada — todos os targets, e o shim de Windows que o chama"

